}{3!}{x}^{3}+⋯.\n$$\n\nComputing the necessary derivatives, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x) \\\\ f(0) & =\\pi \\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=\\pi  \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =-{\\pi }^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x) \\\\ {f}^{′}(0) & =-{\\pi }^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)=0 \\\\ {f}^{″}(x) & =-{\\pi }^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x) \\\\ {f}^{″}(0) & =-{\\pi }^{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=-{\\pi }^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Maclaurin expansion is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x & =(\\pi )+(0)x+\\frac{(-{\\pi }^{3})}{2!}{x}^{2}+⋯ \\\\  & =\\pi -\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}{x}^{2}}{2}+⋯.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346666 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346667 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346668 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346669 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346670 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1041 "selection" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346670 13194139535379 true] [17592186346665 1110 #uuid "5028ba9a-b847-523f-aa62-35f46f66927a" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346666 1034 "\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)=\\pi -\\frac{\\pi {x}^{2}}{3}+⋯" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346666 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535379 true] [17592186346666 1111 #uuid "fdd7b7e1-da9e-5123-9867-9b42364955a8" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346667 1034 "\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)=1-\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}{x}^{2}}{2}+⋯" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346667 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535379 true] [17592186346667 1111 #uuid "b71c631c-4dbf-541f-aa87-1c47aecacd1c" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346668 1034 "\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)=\\pi x+\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}{x}^{3}}{6}+⋯" 13194139535379 true] [17592186346668 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535379 